# Tuning values the sim reads from the TUNE section. A change here is a data edit: the engine reloads it
# with the rest of the scenario. Every value must be present; a missing or out-of-range value refuses the map.
#
# structure_scan_cells: cells a unit's bucket scan reaches past its weapon range (structures are bucketed at
#   their centre, beyond the footprint edge).
# teleport_ring_points / teleport_ring_steps: landing ring for the teleport effect, directions and widening steps.
# best_only: item stats that take the largest value any active item gives, instead of the sum.
# xp_curve: cumulative xp at which character levels 2 to 30 are reached (level 1 needs none). UNVERIFIED: the
#   reference table is an engine constant absent from the npc dump; recalled, and the 720 and 750 steps to levels
#   7 and 8 match the patch 7.21 notes.
tuning(
    structure_scan_cells=3,
    teleport_ring_points=8,
    teleport_ring_steps=6,
    best_only=["scepter", "shard", "crit_chance", "crit_multiplier", "cleave", "cleave_distance", "cleave_start_width", "cleave_end_width", "bash_chance", "bash_duration", "night_vision"],
    xp_curve=[200, 500, 900, 1400, 2000, 2600, 3200, 4400, 5400, 6000, 8200, 9000, 10400, 11900, 13500, 15200, 17000, 18900, 20900, 23000, 25200, 27500, 29900, 32400],
)
